{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577080/extras/6cfdcd0e29254a61ec514310834cb975.poster.avif?t=1756107419\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577080/extras/6cfdcd0e29254a61ec514310834cb975.webm?t=1756107419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577080/extras/6cfdcd0e29254a61ec514310834cb975.mp4?t=1756107419\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577080/extras/2dad953e6964312d278674979fc37f3c.avif?t=1756107419\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577080/extras_big/2dad953e6964312d278674979fc37f3c.webp?t=1756107419 width=1600 height=229 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>My Dear Emma</i> is a heartfelt narrative adventure and life simulation that intertwines the emotional journey of Emma, a young biologist and photographer with the enduring legacy of her late grandfather. Inspired by real-life stories, this deeply personal tale invites players to uncover memories, family secrets, and reflections on love, loss, and the ties that shape us.  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577080/extras/7308403ae8e4eb75258d67977cd5ca33.avif?t=1756107419\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577080/extras_big/7308403ae8e4eb75258d67977cd5ca33.avif?t=1756107419 width=1600 height=288 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After inheriting her grandparents\u2019 old house, Emma returns to the countryside to begin a new chapter in her life. As you settle into her new home, you\u2019ll shape her daily routines, explore her surroundings, and connect with the community, while unraveling the emotional threads of her past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577080/extras/6aa4374a9a73b82fbfed278330b4d022.avif?t=1756107419\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577080/extras_big/6aa4374a9a73b82fbfed278330b4d022.webp?t=1756107419 width=1600 height=229 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a beautifully crafted world seen through Emma\u2019s eyes, where exploration of intimate moments blends seamlessly with powerful themes such as sustainability, animal welfare, and the fight against global warming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577080/extras/a49ec547c059d4d08d8def80b6fb0d8c.avif?t=1756107419\" width=1536 height=320 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>My Dear Emma</i>\u00a0is a journey of emotional connection, personal growth, and everyday life. It offers a rare balance between heartfelt storytelling, life simulation, and meaningful real-world issues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emotional, character-driven narrative inspired by true events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Life simulation elements: manage daily routines, explore, and interact with the local community</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stunning, atmospheric environments rich with detail</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration of vital topics: sustainability, animal welfare, climate change</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique blend of storytelling, education, and personal reflection</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you so much! Your wishlist truly helps this project. We\u2019re a small, diverse, and multicultural indie studio from Frankfurt, Germany \ud83c\udde9\ud83c\uddea.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2577080?t=1756107419","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577080/9318c0c42e801f89248c533e9b893000530cc4ba/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756107419","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577080/6f4006f328083432d80e7efd0202a9a789c22907/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756107419","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577080/6f4006f328083432d80e7efd0202a9a789c22907/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756107419","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577080/extras/6cfdcd0e29254a61ec514310834cb975.poster.avif?t=1756107419\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577080/extras/6cfdcd0e29254a61ec514310834cb975.webm?t=1756107419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577080/extras/6cfdcd0e29254a61ec514310834cb975.mp4?t=1756107419\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577080/extras/2dad953e6964312d278674979fc37f3c.avif?t=1756107419\" data-big-src=https://sha